When `frameMax = 0` (meaning "unlimited" per AMQP spec), `Math.min(67108864, 0) = 0`. This value is then passed to `Utils.framePayloadLimit(0)` which returns `Integer.MAX_VALUE` (line 77-79 of Utils.java):

